  "body": "Currently, headings in `<summary>` elements are not allowed and do not show up in the accessibility tree as headings. For accordions and other use cases, using headings inside the `<summary>` makes a lot of sense. Navigating to a heading inside the summary should set the focus to the `summary` and then have the expected interaction to open and close the `details` element.",
